WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.306
Still copying web pages into your automations by hand?

00:00:04.556 --> 00:00:08.376
Send to Webhook sends any page, link, image or text you select

00:00:08.376 --> 00:00:12.699
to your own n8n, Make, Zapier or Clay workflow.

00:00:13.149 --> 00:00:15.426
First, get your webhook URL.

00:00:15.426 --> 00:00:18.726
In n8n, add a Webhook node, set it to POST,

00:00:18.726 --> 00:00:23.847
copy the Production URL, not the Test URL, and publish the workflow.

00:00:24.047 --> 00:00:28.649
In Make, Zapier or Clay, create a webhook trigger and copy its URL.

00:00:28.849 --> 00:00:34.880
It should start with https. Plain http only works for a local n8n.

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:38.760
Paste it into the settings page that opens after you install,

00:00:38.760 --> 00:00:40.081
and click Save.

00:00:40.131 --> 00:00:43.517
Chrome asks once to allow that website. Click Allow.

00:00:43.617 --> 00:00:45.257
Then click Send test.

00:00:45.257 --> 00:00:48.731
A 200 and your workflow's reply mean it's connected.

00:00:49.181 --> 00:00:51.473
Now, on any page, click the icon.

00:00:51.493 --> 00:00:54.193
You'll see the page and any text you selected.

00:00:54.193 --> 00:00:56.543
Add a note if you like, and click Send.

00:00:56.743 --> 00:01:00.983
Or right-click a page, link, image or selection, and choose Send to.

00:01:01.333 --> 00:01:04.243
Your workflow gets the same clean JSON every time:

00:01:04.243 --> 00:01:09.113
type, URL, title, selected text, your note and more.

00:01:09.263 --> 00:01:12.991
Need the words on the page too? Tick Include the page text.

00:01:13.441 --> 00:01:15.571
If something's wrong, it tells you how to fix it,

00:01:15.571 --> 00:01:18.725
like publishing your n8n workflow.

00:01:18.925 --> 00:01:21.565
It only sends when you ask, only to your webhook,

00:01:21.565 --> 00:01:24.765
and never reads password or card boxes.

00:01:25.115 --> 00:01:28.266
Send to Webhook. Free, by imisofts.
